# Reviewed dependency-advisory exceptions.
#
# The `pip-audit` step in CI is blocking: a known vulnerability fails the
# release gate. This file is the only way to proceed without fixing one, and
# every entry is a deliberate, auditable decision — not a silent waiver.
#
# Format: one advisory id per line (`GHSA-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx` or `PYSEC-YYYY-NNN`).
# Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#
# Every entry MUST record, in the comment above it:
#   - why the vulnerability does not affect Voice Buddy, or why the fix cannot
#     be taken yet
#   - who reviewed it and when
#   - the condition under which the exception should be removed
#
# Example:
#   # GHSA-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx — aiohttp server-side request parsing. Voice Buddy
#   # only uses aiohttp as an edge-tts client and never serves requests.
#   # Reviewed: <name>, 2026-08-19. Remove when edge-tts allows aiohttp >= X.
#   GHSA-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx
#
# There are currently no exceptions. `pip-audit` reports clean.
